WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.360
Hello, my name is Sarah, I run a boutique publishing house here in the Sunshine Coast

00:07.360 --> 00:10.560
called Hinterland Co in Australia.

00:10.560 --> 00:16.840
And I first contacted Omer maybe three to four months ago in the team at Zumetrix

00:16.840 --> 00:23.360
to help me to finalize the billing system for a client portal.

00:23.360 --> 00:29.240
And it was a subscription service, so it was a little bit difficult and Omer has simplified

00:29.240 --> 00:33.880
everything, created great handover notes for me and got the whole thing ticking along

00:33.880 --> 00:35.040
really well.

00:35.040 --> 00:41.680
What has really stood out to me is his very easy going attitude and he always seems to

00:41.680 --> 00:46.600
be available for my annoying questions and answers them with a lot of patience.

00:46.600 --> 00:52.080
So his after sales support continues to this day and is greatly appreciated.

00:52.080 --> 00:52.720
Thank you Omer.

